\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The Research Onion (adapted from \cite {saunders2019research}), illustrating the nested layers of philosophical and methodological choice. This thesis occupies a post-positivist realist position, adopts a deductive approach, employs an experimental mono-method quantitative strategy, and applies a cross-sectional time horizon with a simulated longitudinal component in Chapter\nobreakspace {}5.}}{22}{figure.3.1}%
